        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Pap ribam khou hei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Pap ribam khou hei tingkau guang nah,",
            "Sau pirun runloumei 8#@ thai na;",
            "Lung rianrana kalum bam khou,",
            "Jei luang kumma talan dui kei Getsamani khou,",
            "Nim kan the Israel nun ruina.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Lani mak ge, lani makge,",
            "Israel nang rui lani mak;",
            "Karu khou ti nkhuailou khang meinun rui phuna,",
            "Pilat nang latjan su han datro.",
            "",
            "2. Kandih guang lani mak Judah nun,",
            "Kalvari ching rukhou hian bin louna;",
            "Kapui Mary lung rianrana,",
            "Munrim gaimei tuai kanmei 8#@ kalung rianrana,",
            "Guang supui ram 8#@ la mak khou rui.",
            "",
            "3. Rianra the tarou lung jingmei khou,",
            "Aniu guangh njangmei tat pui nung mu;",
            "Jerusalem rakai lung khou,",
            "Khamthing phei siat kak kan the, banglani jai the,",
            "Nthanmei bumang than guang dat ro.",
            "",
            "4. Riu kanthe pap ri adou tang khou,",
            "Kandih hei poubaumei le Khrista ram;",
            "Pap rita ngammei guang daimei,",
            "Nthuk pui jei rui liu lou the kalvari ching khou,",
            "Ncham lou kan the poubaumei rui."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
